sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Visitor browser
    participant W as Website Worker
    participant Q as Cloudflare Queue
    participant C as Private consumer Worker
    participant O as Google OAuth
    participant S as Google Sheets
    participant D as Dead-letter Queue

    B->>W: Submit minimal consented form payload
    W->>W: Resolve feature, privacy, Turnstile and Queue gates
    W->>W: Enforce JSON, rate limits, 8 KiB limit and strict schema
    W->>W: Verify Turnstile and apply post-verification rate limit
    alt Filled honeypot decoy
        W-->>B: Return the same 202 Accepted without enqueueing
    else Genuine non-honeypot submission
        W->>W: Create server timestamps
        W->>Q: Enqueue stable ID and minimal approved contract
        Q-->>W: Confirm durable Queue acceptance
        W-->>B: Return 202 after Queue acceptance, while Sheets is still pending
        Q->>C: Deliver private batch
        C->>C: Validate exact 14-field internal contract
        C->>O: Request Sheets-scoped OAuth token with consumer-only credentials
        O-->>C: Return scoped token to the private consumer
        C->>S: Read the submission-ID column
        S-->>C: Return existing IDs

        alt Duplicate ID already stored or repeated in the batch
            C-->>Q: Acknowledge duplicate message
        else Unseen ID
            C->>S: Append unseen row with RAW values
            alt Append confirmed
                S-->>C: Confirm append
                C-->>Q: Acknowledge confirmed message
            else Transient consumer or Google failure
                C-->>Q: Request retry without logging the payload
                alt Retry budget remains
                    Q->>C: Redeliver the message
                else Retries exhausted
                    Q->>D: Move the message to the dead-letter Queue
                end
            end
        end

        Note over Q,C: At-least-once delivery plus stable IDs
        Note over Q,C: Idempotent convergence
        Note over Q,C: Not distributed exactly-once delivery
    end
